+/**
+ * Chapter: cardiovascular — 45 conditions.
+ * Same extended format as the gastrointestinal chapter (fields 10 and 11 carry
+ * red flags and complications).
+ * Sources followed: WHO/ISH hypertension guidance, ESC and AHA/ACC statements,
+ * WHO essential medicines for heart failure and ischaemic heart disease.
+ */
+export const CARDIOVASCULAR = `
+CAR-001|I10|cardiovascular|Hypertension (primary)|فشار خون بالا|usually asymptomatic • headache in severe cases • dizziness • epistaxis • discovered on screening|clinic blood pressure on two occasions • ambulatory monitoring if borderline • urinalysis, electrolytes, creatinine, glucose, lipids • ECG and fundoscopy|thiazide, ACE inhibitor/ARB or calcium channel blocker by age and comorbidity • lifestyle: salt under 5 g, weight loss, exercise, stop smoking • review every 3 months until controlled • treat to below 140/90 (below 130/80 if tolerated)|فشار خون بالا؛ کاهش نمک و وزن، یک یا دو دوا، پایش منظم.|blood pressure above 180/120 with symptoms • chest pain • focal neurology|stroke • heart failure • chronic kidney disease • retinopathy
+CAR-002|I11.9|cardiovascular|Hypertensive heart disease|بیماری قلبی ناشی از فشار خون|exertional breathlessness • ankle swelling • palpitations • long-standing hypertension|ECG for left ventricular hypertrophy • echocardiography • BNP where available • assess renal function|blood pressure control is the treatment • diuretic for congestion • ACE inhibitor or ARB • salt restriction and daily weights|بیماری قلبی فشار خون؛ کنترل فشار و دیورتیک.|orthopnoea • nocturnal dyspnoea • weight gain|heart failure • arrhythmia • sudden death
+CAR-003|I12.9|cardiovascular|Hypertensive nephropathy|نفروپاتی فشار خون|nocturia • oedema • rising creatinine • proteinuria • long-standing hypertension|urine albumin to creatinine ratio • creatinine and electrolytes • renal ultrasound • exclude other causes of kidney disease|tight blood pressure control with ACE inhibitor or ARB • salt restriction • avoid NSAIDs and nephrotoxins • monitor potassium|نفروپاتی فشار؛ مهار ACE و کنترل دقیق فشار.|oliguria • rapidly rising creatinine|chronic kidney disease • dialysis • cardiovascular events
+CAR-004|I16.1|cardiovascular|Hypertensive emergency|فوریت فشار خون|crisis blood pressure with organ damage • chest pain • severe headache with confusion • breathlessness • visual loss|repeat blood pressure with correct cuff • ECG, troponin, creatinine, urinalysis • fundoscopy • look for aortic dissection|admit and lower pressure gradually (about 25 percent in the first hour) • IV infusion with a titratable agent • treat the specific syndrome • avoid rapid drops that cause ischaemia|فوریت فشار خون؛ کاهش تدریجی با دوا وریدی و درمان عارضه.|confusion • chest pain • reduced urine output|stroke • myocardial infarction • aortic dissection • renal failure
