+SEA-001|T67.0|seasonal|Heat stroke|گرمازدگی|core temperature above 40 C • confusion or collapse • hot dry skin • tachycardia • hypotension|core temperature measurement • check for organ dysfunction: creatinine, electrolytes, liver enzymes • distinguish heat exhaustion (sweating, alert) from heat stroke (altered mentation)|cool immediately: ice packs to neck, axillae and groin, cold water spray, fan • IV fluids • stop cooling at 38.5 C • ICU for organ support • avoid antipyretics and anticholinergics|گرمازدگی؛ سردکردن فوری بدن، مایعات وریدی، مراقبت شدید.
