+SEA-004|T67.4|seasonal|Heat syncope|سنکوپ گرمایی|brief loss of consciousness in heat • rapid recovery when supine • pallor • sweating • no confusion after waking|supine position with legs raised • check glucose and blood pressure • ECG if recurrent • exclude cardiac cause in the elderly|rehydration and rest in a cool area • do not stand abruptly • review antihypertensive and diuretic doses in summer|سنکوپ گرمایی؛ خوابیدن و بالا بردن پاها، مایعات، بازبینی دواهای فشار.
